<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Inmobiliaria Futura - Prueba de Bienes Raíces</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #1a365d;
            --secondary: #2b6cb0;
            --accent: #ecc94b;
            --text: #2d3748;
            --light: #f7fafc;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            color: var(--text);
            background-color: var(--light);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem 5%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 1.5rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(26, 54, 93, 0.7), rgba(26, 54, 93, 0.7)), url('https://unsplash.com') no-repeat center center/cover;
            height: 60vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .search-container {
            background: white;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .search-container select, .search-container button {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            min-width: 150px;
        }

        .search-container button {
            background-color: var(--secondary);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .search-container button:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 3rem auto;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 2rem;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .card-img {
            height: 200px;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .badge {
            position: absolute;
            top: 1rem;
            left: 1rem;
            background-color: var(--accent);
            color: var(--primary);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .card-content {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .price {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--secondary);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .features {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            color: #718096;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
            padding-top: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .contact-section {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 4rem 1rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .contact-form {
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 2rem auto 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .contact-form input, .contact-form textarea {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: none;
            font-size: 1rem;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .contact-form button {
            background-color: var(--accent);
            color: var(--primary);
            border: none;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }

        .contact-form button:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            .search-container { flex-direction: column; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <a href="#" class="logo">🏠 FuturaRaíces</a>
        <nav>
            <a href="#propiedades">Propiedades</a>
            <a href="#contacto">Contacto</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Encuentra tu hogar ideal</h1>
        <p>Explora las mejores ofertas de venta en tu zona</p>
        
        <div class="search-container">
            <select id="tipo">
                <option value="">Tipo de inmueble</option>
                <option value="casa">Casa</option>
                <option value="apto">Apartamento</option>
            </select>
            <select id="precio">
                <option value="">Rango de Precio</option>
                <option value="bajo">Hasta $150,000</option>
                <option value="alto">Más de $150,000</option>
            </select>
            <button onclick="buscar()">Buscar Propiedades</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <main class="container" id="propiedades">
        <h2 class="section-title">Propiedades Destacadas</h2>
        
        <div class="grid">
            <!-- Tarjeta 1 -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img" style="background-image: url('https://unsplash.com');">
                    <span class="badge">Venta</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <p class="price">$245,000</p>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Residencia Moderna en Zona Norte</h3>
                    <p style="color: #4a5568; font-size: 0.9rem;">Exclusivo sector residencial con excelente conectividad y vigilancia 24/7.</p>
                    <div class="features">
                        <span>🛏️ 3 Hab</span>
                        <span>🚿 2 Baños</span>
                        <span>📐 150 m²</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tarjeta 2 -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img" style="background-image: url('https://unsplash.com');">
                    <span class="badge">Venta</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <p class="price">$135,000</p>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Apartamento con Vista Panorámica</h3>
                    <p style="color: #4a5568; font-size: 0.9rem;">Ubicado en piso alto, acabados de lujo y balcón con excelente iluminación natural.</p>
                    <div class="features">
                        <span>🛏️ 2 Hab</span>
                        <span>🚿 2 Baños</span>
                        <span>📐 85 m²</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tarjeta 3 -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img" style="background-image: url('https://unsplash.com');">
                    <span class="badge">Venta</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <p class="price">$310,000</p>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Casa Familiar con Amplio Jardín</h3>
                    <p style="color: #4a5568; font-size: 0.9rem;">Perfecta para familias, cuenta con patio trasero, zona de BBQ y garaje doble.</p>
                    <div class="features">
                        <span>🛏️ 4 Hab</span>
                        <span>🚿 3 Baños</span>
                        <span>📐 220 m²</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <section class="contact-section" id="contacto">
        <h2>¿Interesado en vender o comprar?</h2>
